fix+cleanup(settings): 6-point Settings tidy + retention-resets-to-30 bug

Mason's cleanup list:
1. Appearance moved to the TOP.
2. Multi-agent copy simplified (two one-line descriptions, no walls of text).
3. Model card REMOVED (model choice is per-agent in the Agents tab).
4. Local Models = DOWNLOAD-ONLY here; selection happens per-agent in Agents
   (dropped the in-Settings selection + its orphaned state/effect).
5. BUG FIX: checkpoint retention always snapped back to 30. Cause: the get/set
   retention commands used broker.root_for("default") (legacy hardcoded scope)
   while writes landed on the real agent folder — read != write. Now both use
   active_checkpoint_root() = the ACTIVE agent's folder, so a set persists.
6. Agent Folder card REMOVED (folder is set per-agent in the Agents tab).

Settings is now: Appearance, Multi-agent, Providers, Local Models (download),
Memory, Checkpoints. Cleaner + correct.
First compile of the retention-root fix (adds db state to the two cmds) — flag
if cargo throws.
